<!-- ===================== PROCESS ===================== -->
<section class="section surface-alt has-ripples assemble" id="process" data-assemble>
  <svg class="ripples ripples-l" viewBox="0 0 400 400" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-drift="0.12"><circle cx="200" cy="200" r="40"/><circle cx="200" cy="200" r="78"/><circle cx="200" cy="200" r="118"/><circle cx="200" cy="200" r="158"/><circle cx="200" cy="200" r="198"/><circle cx="200" cy="200" r="239"/><circle class="drop" cx="200" cy="200" r="3.5"/></svg>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="left">
        <span class="eyebrow on-navy reveal"><svg class="iris-mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5.2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>How it works</span>
        <h2 class="h2 reveal" data-d="1">From outside looking in, to inside the channel.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="muted reveal" data-d="2" style="max-width:34ch">A clear, sequenced engagement.<br /><b>No</b> open-ended retainers, no theory without traction.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="proc-wrap asm-stage">
      <div class="proc-line"><div class="fill asm-grow"></div></div>
      <div class="proc-grid">
        <div class="proc-step asm-rise"><div class="dot"></div><svg class="step-iris" viewBox="0 0 34 34" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg><div class="pn">Step 01</div><h3>Diagnose</h3><p>We assess fit, readiness and the realistic shape of US demand for your offer.</p></div>
        <div class="proc-step asm-rise"><div class="dot"></div><svg class="step-iris" viewBox="0 0 34 34" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="8"/></svg><div class="pn">Step 02</div><h3>Map</h3><p>We design the channel architecture and identify the partners worth pursuing.</p></div>
        <div class="proc-step asm-rise"><div class="dot"></div><svg class="step-iris" viewBox="0 0 34 34" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="8"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="13"/></svg><div class="pn">Step 03</div><h3>Connect</h3><p>We open doors with structured introductions to vetted partners and buyers.</p></div>
        <div class="proc-step asm-rise"><div class="dot"></div><svg class="step-iris" viewBox="0 0 34 34" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="8"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="13"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="16.4" opacity=".5"/></svg><div class="pn">Step 04</div><h3>Enable</h3><p>We equip the channel to sell and hand you a running commercial engine.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===================== WHY US ===================== -->
<section class="section surface-page" id="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="why-grid reveal">
      <div class="why-visual">
      <div class="globe-stage" data-parallax="0.02">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" role="img" aria-label="Global routes converging on the United States">
          <circle class="globe-outer" cx="100" cy="100" r="80"></circle>
          <ellipse class="meridian" cx="100" cy="100" rx="80" ry="80"></ellipse>
          <ellipse class="meridian" cx="100" cy="100" rx="60" ry="80"></ellipse>
          <ellipse class="meridian" cx="100" cy="100" rx="38" ry="80"></ellipse>
          <ellipse class="meridian" cx="100" cy="100" rx="14" ry="80"></ellipse>
          <line class="latitude" x1="20" y1="100" x2="180" y2="100"></line>
          <ellipse class="latitude" cx="100" cy="100" rx="80" ry="58"></ellipse>
          <ellipse class="latitude" cx="100" cy="100" rx="80" ry="30"></ellipse>
          <!-- flight arcs -->
          <path class="arc a1" d="M40,150 Q70,70 96,104"></path>
          <path class="arc a2" d="M60,40 Q110,60 96,104"></path>
          <path class="arc a3" d="M160,150 Q120,120 96,104"></path>
          <!-- origin nodes -->
          <circle class="node" cx="40" cy="150" r="2.4"></circle>
          <circle class="node" cx="60" cy="40" r="2.4"></circle>
          <circle class="node" cx="160" cy="150" r="2.4"></circle>
          <!-- destination (US) -->
          <circle class="node-pulse" cx="96" cy="104" r="4"></circle>
          <circle class="dest" cx="96" cy="104" r="4"></circle>
        </svg>
      </div>
        <figure class="photo-card surface-card reveal" data-d="1">
          <picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="assets/img/us-night-480.webp 480w, assets/img/us-night-960.webp 960w, assets/img/us-night-1600.webp 1600w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 460px, calc(100vw - 80px)"><img src="assets/img/us-night-960.webp" width="1600" height="1067" alt="Satellite view of the United States at night, with city lights tracing the major metropolitan areas and the highway corridors between them." loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow reveal"><span class="sec-index">03</span> &nbsp;Why the US market</span>
        <h2 class="h2 why-title reveal" data-d="1">The largest opportunity<br />is also the hardest to read.</h2>
        <p class="lead reveal" data-d="2" style="margin-bottom:8px">The United States is a continent of distinct regional markets, regulatory regimes and buying cultures. Winning it is rarely about the product - it's all about the channels.</p>
        <div class="why-stats reveal" data-d="3">
          <div class="why-stat"><div class="n">$24 Trillion<span data-count="27" data-suffix="T"></span></div><div class="l">US consumer + B2B economy</div></div>
          <div class="why-stat"><div class="n"><span data-count="50"></span></div><div class="n" style="font-size:46px;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:46.4px">50 States</span></div><div class="l">State markets, one entry strategy</div></div>
          <div class="why-stat"><div class="n"><span data-count="70" data-suffix="%"></span></div><div class="l">Of B2B revenue flows through partners</div></div>
          <div class="why-stat"><div class="n"><span data-count="3" data-suffix="x"></span></div><div class="l">Faster scale with the right channel</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

